From: kurtxtb <s0917077331@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:19:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(plugins): add PlatformSpoof
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rewrite of fshin's Revenge PlatformSpoof for Rain: patch the live
GatewaySocket's send (an instance field on Discord 348) to swap
properties.browser in IDENTIFY, and re-identify only when the live session
doesn't match the chosen platform — on CONNECTION_OPEN (covers the native
fast-connect identify at boot) and when the setting changes — instead of
polling the socket every 250ms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
